OL,3,GNEWSAReopening line 'a no-brainer' or
OL,4,A'insanely expensive'?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a resident living close to the
OL,7,Fdisused line told the BBC that
OL,8,Fre-opening it would be "insanely
OL,9,Fexpensive and for very little gain".
